#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "One sentence naming the KIND of thing being chosen, not the options — \"which cache strategy\", never \"A or B\". Then the trigger: is this irreversible, or would the answer surprise someone? If neither, say so and stop; the calling step decides without this subprocess. Stopping here is a correct outcome, not a skipped step."
